      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WE CAN (1) hit the ground running from the squeeze draw with a slick early split, holding on for a minor placing when second and beaten 1.5 lengths at this track over 525m in 30.63. One of the leading chances. KIWI EDDIE (7) ran a good time (31.81) when placing three back at Ballarat but has missed the frame since, last time out finishing fourth (30.85) at this track. Has the ability and looks a key chance here. AUTUMN GOLD (2) was in the money last time out when third and beaten 6 lengths at Warrnambool over 450m (25.53). Missed the placings only try here. Hard to beat again. STOP AND STARE (8) was in the money two back in a Restricted WIN H at this track then jumped from a squeeze draw last time and was not far away when second (34.73) over 600m at this track.",
